    "body": "Rather than a new term and definition for \"being rendered by its children\", would it be sufficient to say \"the element or at least one of its descendants is being rendered\"? One scenario to consider, that is potentially not covered by the PR text is a focusable container, hidden with `visibility: hidden;` for which at least one descendant is set to `visibility: visible;`",
    "created_at": "2023-10-15T23:22:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-15T23:24:36Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9425#discussion_r1359970369",
